  message: "Bakeoff finding (deep-20260320-163609, rocksdb): third-party/gtest-1.8.1/ is classified as tier 1 (first_party) instead of tier 3 (external_dep). This inflates tier 1 with 1823 gtest nodes and contaminates symbol rankings. Fix: detect common vendored/third-party directory patterns (third-party/, vendor/, third_party/, external/) and classify as tier 3."  # 2bd2
